    "Main result (paper-closest row = raw ciphertext): plaintext BLEU=63.73 -> CAPRISE raw BLEU=9.26 (-85.5%); the stronger scale-normalising attacker reaches BLEU=30.29 (still below plaintext; privacy upper bound, F3/A11). Paper Table II: 83.021 -> 12.425.",
